{"articleNo":"55156","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=55156&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"★ 2012 학생창업 챔피언십 경진대회 모집(- 5,17)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.05.14","hit":"4677","attachments":[{"name":"개요.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=55156&attachNo=70402"},{"name":"학생창업 챔피언십 경진대회 공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=55156&attachNo=70403"},{"name":"참가신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=55156&attachNo=70460"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">학생창업 챔피언십 경진대회</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">대회개요</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ 대회명 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2012</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 학생창업 챔피언십 경진대회&nbsp; </span></font></strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">(부제: 캠퍼스 영웅전</font></strong>)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ 목적</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○ 행동지향적이고, 문제해결 중심의 창업교육 실현</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학생들에게 창업에 필요한 기업가마인드, 창의성, 도전정신, 협업 등을 경험할 수 있는 기회 제공</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ 대회기간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 2012. 5. 29 ~ 10월 말</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ 부트캠프</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 2012. 5. 29(화) ~ 31일(수)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; FONT-FAMILY: '한양중고딕,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 부트캠프 후 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '한양중고딕,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2차 미션</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; FONT-FAMILY: '한양중고딕,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 진출팀 20개 선발예정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ 시상식</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 10월 말(산학연협력 EXPO 시)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ 해외 기업가마인드 탐방(최우수팀에 한함) : 12월</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ 추진체계 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ (</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">주최) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">교육과학기술부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ (</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">주관) 한국청년기업가정신재단</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ 참가대상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 산학협력 선도대학 대학생 300명 (1팀당 약 5명)</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;○ 5명 중 3명 이상은 다른 전공자</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;○ 5명 중 1명은 방송반 등 영상촬영 및 편집이 가능한 학생</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;○ 경진대회 참가학생 전원에게 출석인정 협조</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 행사 참가인증서는 한국청년기업가정신재단이 발행 예정</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 15pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">□ 우승자 특전</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;○ 교과부 장관상 및 해외 기업가마인드 체험기회 제공</span></p><p style=\"LIN